MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_001: Ngaah!
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_002: Was that the last? I could go on, but this shall have\nto suffice.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_003: You just smashed that dummy in a single blow!\nPretty impressive, Theodora.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_004: Ah, Alexandra. As ever, you do not shy away\nfrom danger.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_005: I nearly killed you before, didn't I? You have seen\nwhat I made of the training dummy.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_006: Had things gone any differently during our match,\nyou would now be in as many pieces.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_007: I don't doubt it. You were truly terrifying that day.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_008: But it also looked like you were suffering terribly.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_009: Like you were sinking in a dark ocean, struggling\nfor air... That's something I'll never forget.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_010: Are you implying the queen of Saramis was at risk\nof drowning?
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_011: That is an irony, given how I spent my childhood.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_012: Ha! You finally cracked a smile! I daresay you look\nalmost...approachable.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_013: You're really quite lovely, you know. It's a shame\nyou've got that furrowed brow on all the time.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_014: It's instantly intimidating. One look, and my\nshoulders tense up immediately.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_015: Were you intimidated? I would not have known it\nto look at you.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_016: To speak so boldly to a queen hardly suggests\nan anxious disposition.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_017: I shall admit you have made me sheepish to be\nso tense.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_018: My position did not allow me to apologize before,\nbut I am sorry, Alexandra.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_019: Oh, please don't! It looks like you're about to frown\nagain, and I'd much prefer a smile over an apology.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_020: Your Majesty should not hang her head like that to a\nlowly knight like me.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_021: Listen, how about we do something fun? Like take\ntea together sometime?
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_022: We could talk, get to know each other, and\njust...relax.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_023: You are on the verge of overstepping. That takes\nmore bravery than you credit yourself with.
MID_SE_Seo_Ale_C_024: But no matter. For you, I shall prepare an assortment\nof the finest sweets Saramis has to offer.